their own. The card pictures (tools/mkcards.py), the suits, the rank
fonts, the backs and the icon are drawn for this program. No PySolFC
code is run by the build or the tests; it was read only.

Veranda
-------

Veranda (MIT licence) is not part of this repository; the program is
built against its SDK. veranda/test/play.s is adapted from Veranda's own
test player (tests/sdk_play.s, MIT licence).
